{"id":"n61642-1-7","stage":3,"title":"사용자 · 用户","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61642-1-7-1","ko":"최근 컴퓨터 사용자의 연령은 어떻게 됩니까?","zh":"最近使用电脑的人群年龄是怎样的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"최근","meaning":"最近；近来","explanation":"최근：最近；近来","readings":[{"term":"최근","audio":"/audio/8124e8864e492d6db495.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89862","senseId":"1","lemma":"최근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"컴퓨터","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사용자의","meaning":"用户，消费者","explanation":"사용자：用户，消费者；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사용자","audio":"/audio/1ac6e422b7dc00bbcdc3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61642","senseId":"1","lemma":"사용자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연령은","meaning":"年龄","explanation":"연령：年龄；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"연령","audio":"/audio/f8eb22dacb7bdb3e18df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14015","senseId":"1","lemma":"연령","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됩니까?","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"5","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8124e8864e492d6d","term":"최근","zh":"最近；近来","audio":"/audio/8124e8864e492d6db495.mp3","entryId":"89862","definition":"从不久前的日子到现在。","pronunciation":["최ː근","췌ː근"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线