0493","senseId":"2","lemma":"어르신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다양합니다.","meaning":"丰富，多种多样","explanation":"다양하다：丰富，多种多样；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"다양하다","audio":"/audio/97b9c42a4d71bc026ff4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40558","senseId":"1","lemma":"다양하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"883924e23c907a13","term":"어린아이","zh":"小孩","audio":"/audio/883924e23c907a13d4ed.mp3","entryId":"70503","definition":"年纪小的孩子。","pronunciation":["어리나이"]},{"id":"97108fcb6a0f1770","term":"팔십","zh":"八十","audio":"/audio/97108fcb6a0f17706307.mp3","entryId":"26908","definition":"十的八倍的数目。","pronunciation":["팔씹"]},{"id":"1bcc05bddb3c9e8c","term":"세","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3","entryId":"64008","definition":"计算岁数的单位。","pronunciation":["세ː"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"以上","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"数量或程度好于或高于一定基准。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"b48d927c3256dc3f","term":"어르신","zh":"老人家，老伯，尊长","audio":"/audio/b48d927c3256dc3fc017.mp3","entryId":"70493","definition":"(敬语)父亲的朋友或比父亲年长的长辈。","pronunciation":["어ː르신"]},{"id":"97b9c42a4d71bc02","term":"다양하다","zh":"丰富，多种多样","audio":"/audio/97b9c42a4d71bc026ff4.mp3","entryId":"40558","definition":"颜色、模样、种类、内容等各种各样，种类繁多。","pronunciation":["다양하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bf0ddcb9136debac108.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.97,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61642","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":107,"sequenceScore":2.7967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近使用电脑的人群年龄是怎样的？","从小孩子到八十岁以上的老人，年龄层非常多样。","请您留下姓名和联系方式，可以吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近使用电脑的人群年龄是怎样的？","从小孩子到八十岁以上的老人，年龄层非常多样。","请您留下姓名和联系方式，可以吗？"],"answer":1}]}
